  "proof_scope": [
    "Actual-Paley pinned clipped-reflection construction preserves mean, sector and both marks. Shallow-deficit repair displacement squared is O(BC*kappa/sqrt(n)); total conic fidelity requires a separate clipped-gap estimate. Main and independent auditor checked constants and n factors.",
    "Five exact-input positive conic trials and one rigorously negative square trial replay at Arb224. Floating Picard depths are proposal provenance, not certified orbit prefixes. Square-trial failure does not disprove conic feasibility.",
    "Joint CP Gram domination holds for all finite threshold families and signed combinations. Actual Paley incidence and corrected trace give Q_0/n -> (1+2*tau)/(4*(1+tau)), while H(0)^2/eta_0 is bounded. This excludes the positive-trace replacement as a uniform HR proof, not HR.",
    "Continuous Arb/Banach covers certify all real nonnegative thresholds at distinct primes 4001,10009,40009,153649 and tau=.01. A repeated stronger 40009 case has ratio below .456. Eight distinct stationary sides, 754 cover intervals including 282 for the repeated case; zero hinges have zero energy.",
    "Exact quintics, Hurwitz determinants, reconstruction denominators and original stationary equations prove nonvanishing holomorphic continuation of both actual reciprocal rows at p17 and q25 on Re(tau)>0. These are two fixed fields.",
    "Written proofs are ordinary mathematical audits, not Lean kernel proofs. Floating identity checks and finite certificates are not asymptotic prime proofs."
